# Vendored shadcn/ui source.
#
# These files are generated by `npx shadcn add` and are meant to be re-fetched
# and re-applied, not hand-formatted — running the WordPress ESLint/Prettier
# rules over them produces thousands of diffs that the next `shadcn add` would
# simply undo. Anything WE write on top of them is linted as normal.
